# Re-read SPEC.md before every change

Before creating, editing, or deleting any file in this plugin:

1. Read `SPEC.md` in full **in this turn**.
2. Do not rely on memory from an earlier turn.
3. If the change and SPEC.md disagree, SPEC.md wins.

Do not add behavior that is not written in SPEC.md.
